{"4134760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Havoc", "steam_appid": 4134760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/932d453cdce9f9a638769eeba6a7e164.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1261 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Havoc</strong> is a sci-fi strategy/action game where you take on the role of a lone captain on a mission to find a solution to the deadlocked war. With your mighty vessel at your command, battle waves of enemy armies, outmaneuver them, collect weaponry, and figure out a way to defeat the Contingency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.poster.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.webm?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.mp4?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every weapon can suit different scenarios. Mix and match between laser, strike crafts, point defense and more to overcome every situation. Learn your arsenal well and you might prevail against the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get to the heart of the enemy's force, you will have to prepare. Some sectors may be overrun by the enemy but reward with precious resources, or cut your losses to fight better another day. The choice is yours; but choose well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select between different battle platform that better suit your playstyle. Each and every one has pros and cons, fitted with different active abilities to devastate the enemy or give you the upper hand if things get too dicey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.poster.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.webm?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.mp4?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous space battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ships with unique abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Go forth, captain. The future of our civilization depends on you.&quot;</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/932d453cdce9f9a638769eeba6a7e164.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1261 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Havoc</strong> is a sci-fi strategy/action game where you take on the role of a lone captain on a mission to find a solution to the deadlocked war. With your mighty vessel at your command, battle waves of enemy armies, outmaneuver them, collect weaponry, and figure out a way to defeat the Contingency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.poster.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.webm?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/696ebf24fed1a47901db48a7b1f4a880.mp4?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every weapon can suit different scenarios. Mix and match between laser, strike crafts, point defense and more to overcome every situation. Learn your arsenal well and you might prevail against the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get to the heart of the enemy's force, you will have to prepare. Some sectors may be overrun by the enemy but reward with precious resources, or cut your losses to fight better another day. The choice is yours; but choose well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command your ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select between different battle platform that better suit your playstyle. Each and every one has pros and cons, fitted with different active abilities to devastate the enemy or give you the upper hand if things get too dicey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.poster.avif?t=1787688219\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.webm?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/extras/19e187dbdba049298ec7c2f37fa63605.mp4?t=1787688219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous space battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ships with unique abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Go forth, captain. The future of our civilization depends on you.&quot;</i></p>", "short_description": "In this sci-fi action/strategy game, you're the only trump card left to stop the Contingency in their destructive march. Man your ship, build your arsenal and blow away the waves sent to stop you in your tracks.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/50dbb5f5e8037468e00bfa1d85c5f84281a643e6/header.jpg?t=1787688219", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/836d64bb66ae9e388d34648a74a75da680ca7826/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787688219", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134760/836d64bb66ae9e388d34648a74a75da680ca7826/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787688219", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cores, 2014 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<